N1  - D18. Capozza et al [30] assessed the role and the calculation of Tp in the ASHRAE method, which resulted in an underestimation of the length of the BHE of more than 10%. 
N1  - D19. In the study, the use of a hybrid optimization technique, integrating a performance map-based near-optimal strategy and the exhaustive search method, resulted in an energy saving of up to 8% for heating and 9% for cooling, compared with ERS solutions. 
