N1  - E8. We concluded that the designed linear model predictive control (MPC) can control nonlinear heat transfer in a vertical ground heat exchanger system around the desired equilibrium point. 
N1  - E9. Model. 
N1  - E10. The paper presents a mathematical model of heat transfer behavior between the liquid inside vertical underground geothermal pipes and the surrounding ground for heating and cooling modes in a ground heat exchanger (GHE) [8].. 
N1  - E11. The model was implemented in MATLAB using an ordinary differential equation (ODE) solver.. 
N1  - E12. The heat transfer model was proposed to evaluate the heat transfer behavior in the GHE between the water in the vertical U-tube pipe and its surrounding grounds for both the heating and cooling modes.. 
