N1  - E24. The proposed method can reduce operating costs by at least 3.78% and at most 12.56% compared to empirical operations [1,2,3,4].. 
N1  - E25. The method derives the solution rapidly while maintaining high computation accuracy, making it suitable for practical problems [5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12].. 
N1  - E26. The optimal operations achieved by the proposed method can be used in practical situations to determine an optimal operating schedule as a day-ahead optimization [13,14,15,16,17,18,19].. 
