N1  - E28. The maximum heat generation and COP of the GSHPs were affected by the ground water temperature, as shown in Fig. 3 [27].. 
N1  - E29. Although GSHPc had relatively high efficiency when the inlet fluid temperature was in the range of 2–12 °C, the COP decreased drastically as the temperature increased.. 
N1  - E30. GSHPh was not efficient compared to GSHPc because the hot water supply temperature from GSHPh was set to 61 °C.. 
