N1  - E32. The outlet fluid temperature of the borefield was calculated using the infinite line source (ILS) model [30,31].. 
N1  - E33. The ILS model with respect to the borehole wall temperature Tb is expressed as T q Csr bðtÞ 1⁄4 Ei b2 þ T0 ð1Þ.. 
